How to read: event_published=NO -> ROS side of the server never sees the set. event yes + server_forwarded NO -> the server callback drops it.
             server_forwarded yes + drone unchanged -> the drone/firmware ignores it. All yes + drone changed -> runtime path works (then the gate/flight script is the problem).
